================================================================================
Third-party material
================================================================================

The files below are NOT original works of this project and are NOT covered by
the Apache-2.0 license above. They are redistributed unmodified as interface and
interoperability material.

1. protocol/glassos/**/*.proto  (excluding google/protobuf/, see item 2)

   gRPC interface definitions for the iFit console service
   `com.ifit.glassos_service`. Extracted verbatim from GlassOS 6.14.6, which
   ships them uncompiled at the archive root of `/system/app/glassos/glassos.apk`
   on a retail NordicTrack console. These are iFit Health & Fitness Inc.'s files,
   reproduced without modification so that message shapes and field numbers can
   be verified against the device rather than guessed.

   Full provenance, including the exact device and firmware build they came from,
   is recorded in protocol/glassos/README.md.

2. protocol/glassos/google/protobuf/*.proto

   Protocol Buffers well-known types.
   Copyright Google Inc. Licensed under BSD-3-Clause.
   https://github.com/protocolbuffers/protobuf

3. apps/spikes/android/app/src/main/assets/glassos/ca_cert.pem
   apps/spikes/android/app/src/main/assets/glassos/client_cert.pem
   apps/spikes/android/app/src/main/assets/glassos/client_key.pem

   Mutual-TLS credentials for the console's loopback-only GlassOS service. This
   material was generated by iFit for the console and read back out of its
   firmware; it is not authored by this project. One fixed set is shared across
   every console of this generation, it authenticates to `127.0.0.1` on hardware
   the operator already owns, and it grants access to no remote account.

   See the "Credentials" section of README.md and docs/PLAN.md section 2.2.


